{"title":"Thursday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922500464/0/marginalrevolution~Thursday-assorted-links.html","date":1753980837000,"content":"<p>1. “Here, we apply econometric causal inference techniques to 740,249 hours of human discourse from 360,445 YouTube academic talks and 771,591 conversational podcast episodes across multiple disciplines. We detect a measurable and abrupt increase in the use of words preferentially generated by ChatGPT, such as delve, comprehend, boast, swift, and meticulous, after its release.”  I wonder if this is more true since <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.01754\" target=\"_blank\">this 2024 paper</a>?  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/RubenHssd/status/1950571655409094881\" target=\"_blank\">a related tweet thread</a>.  I do hear Alex using the word “delve” more.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AlexTISYoung/status/1950575617294180510\" target=\"_blank\">New start-up with claims about embryo screening</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://macleans.ca/society/confessions-of-the-working-poor/?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=ten_tabs&amp;utm_campaign=FIREFOX-EDITORIAL-TENTABS-2025_07_30position=6&amp;category=fascinating_stories&amp;scheduled_corpus_item_id=6aed3908-ecb8-4f68-b9ca-06ad7603fb08&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fmacleans.ca%2Fsociety%2Fconfessions-of-the-working-poor%2F\" target=\"_blank\">A report from “the fast-growing Canadian poor” (not my term)</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://yle.fi/a/74-20174831\" target=\"_blank\">Helsinki goes a full year without a traffic fatality</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/chatgpt21/status/1950606890758476264\" target=\"_blank\">Noam Brown on the new reasoning models and agnosticism</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/yoojinjino/status/1950314130604245389?s=46&amp;t=FJgXVgHgo-AUPu_YVPpRkA\" target=\"_blank\">Claims about Korean studying</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.statecraft.pub/p/how-to-fix-foreign-aid?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1818323&amp;post_id=169690057&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3pbhh&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Dean Karlan on foreign aid and DOGE, with transcript</a>.  Very good piece, credit to Santi Ruiz.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/thursday-assorted-links-513.html\">Thursday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/922500464/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/922500464/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/922500464/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/922500464/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/922500464/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/922500464/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/0